Subject: to mshape or to not mshape
Message-ID: <kjHswI144M4.Ob0_9l_xCgAJ@geomorph-r-package.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/geomorph-r-package/c/kjHswI144M4/m/Ob0_9l_xCgAJ>
