I recently read a paper that used Relative Warps Analysis (RWA) after GPA and calculated evolutionary rates on the relative warp axes. It seemed, and without having any knowledge on RWA, that RWA and PCA are achieving similar goals. Do PCA and RWA give similar results and when should I use one or the other?

Thanks,
Nick

