In-Reply-To: <q0MhotXjZ8A.qZI8cIgQBAAJ@geomorph-r-package.groups.google.com>
References: <q0MhotXjZ8A.4DCunxVKAQAJ@geomorph-r-package.groups.google.com> <q0MhotXjZ8A.qZI8cIgQBAAJ@geomorph-r-package.groups.google.com>
