I did not see anova() used in the examples you provided - just summary() - but regardless, yes, this can happen if removing parameters in the model design matrix results in a term disappearing from the model.  (This might explain completion of model fitting at 50% of expected steps.). I was able to simulate data and confirm this - getting the same sort of results as you. I did it by making a factor with no variation (all the same value).

Mike

